# Thumbnails + srcset sizes are produced during `jekyll build`; never commit them.
assets/photo-gallery/**/*-th.jpg
assets/photo-gallery/**/*-th.webp
assets/photo-gallery/**/*-320.jpg
assets/photo-gallery/**/*-640.jpg
assets/photo-gallery/**/*-960.jpg
assets/photo-gallery/**/*-1600.jpg
assets/photo-gallery/**/*-320.webp
assets/photo-gallery/**/*-640.webp
assets/photo-gallery/**/*-960.webp
assets/photo-gallery/**/*-1600.webp

